WEBVTT

00:36:57.288 --> 00:37:02.704
that the people trust us now and they've
come to understand that protecting

00:37:02.704 --> 00:37:04.954
the environment is for their own future.

00:37:04.954 --> 00:37:09.496
They need the forest for clean air and
clean water to prevent soil erosion

00:37:09.496 --> 00:37:12.246
and and control rainfall and the climate.

00:37:12.829 --> 00:37:16.996
And so they've become our partners
and they help us conserve

00:37:16.996 --> 00:37:21.246
the environment. And we teach about
the animals in our youth program.

00:37:21.538 --> 00:37:25.788
And they're all helping to protect
the animals and tell people about

00:37:25.788 --> 00:37:31.204
the animals. And again, you can't
it's not a blanket answer